    "name": "pairwise_ranked_softplus_aggregated_gap",
    "intuition": "Introduce a pairwise ranking loss using a softplus link on the negative margin between the weighted log-probability difference and a nonlinear combination of advantage_gap and cost_gap signals. The loss aggregates by taking a weighted mean of the softplus outputs, and applies a strict monotonic ranking constraint by emphasizing pairs with higher combined quality gaps. This paradigm shifts from margin-based logsigmoid to a smooth ranking loss with nonlinear signal fusion and weighted mean aggregation.",
